  <item>
    <title>26. 高考特辑-是一站，也是一战</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667bdd4cc13b46d76c04e848</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667bdd4cc13b46d76c04e848</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Jun 2024 09:20:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又到了一年一度的高考出分季节，无论你考的怎么样，都会有不一样的精彩人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>Not limited by the past, nor confined to this moment.</span></p><span></span><p><span>顶流见老师~不出则已 一出惊人<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>高考成绩出好快 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>被高考捆绑的青春 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>早夭“姑妈”伴你读的高三 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是否高考，每个人都面临人生岔路口的选择<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>九九八十一难，填志愿更是难解难 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>张雪峰老师-普通孩子填志愿的神 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>资质审查的老师们刨祖坟也就你们这样了 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>市！场！营！销！不是销售！！（好好好我是）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>专业大祛魅大法好 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>久石让-人生的旋转木马</span></p><span></span><p><span>坂本龙一Merry Christmas Mr. Lawrence</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】老李@vidaLi &nbsp;老王@旺有恰洽發 见老师@YOMEBroken【求关注】小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云音乐｜喜马拉雅｜同步更新！ 更多平台敬请期待 【联系我们】 投稿&amp;合作邮箱：wandoujianer244@163.com 敬请期待听友群～ 感谢收听「豌豆尖儿～」，下期再见</span></p>]]></description>
