  <item>
    <title>24. 无论相爱与否，死亡人人平等</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66289514c3e09d8f371e19e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66289514c3e09d8f371e19e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>生命的意义不在于你创造了多大的价值 而在于不被遗忘 我们都会在名为记忆的时光里成为永恒 -《寻梦环游记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>豌豆尖儿，一周年改版通告～<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>到底谁在说上班如上坟，明明上坟更好玩！！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大癫国的清明节不一样<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>去老祖宗坟头上采蕨菜怪难评的<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>所以我们年轻的时候到底看的是什么！！！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>好像变成无趣的大人了<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>调休比所有生离死别更过分<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我们～云～南～假～期～就～是～多～<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>领导，老师您是没有家人吗？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>好好告别，在潮湿来的时候才会干的快一点<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Maximillian-Losing Game</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hearts&amp;Colors - I'm So Sorry</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】老李@vidaLi &nbsp;老王@旺有恰洽發 见老师@YOMEBroken【求关注】小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云音乐｜喜马拉雅｜同步更新！ 更多平台敬请期待 【联系我们】 投稿&amp;合作邮箱：wandoujian24@163.com 敬请期待听友群～ 感谢收听「豌豆尖儿～」，下期再见</span></p>]]></description>
