    <title>22. 三八妇女节特辑：供桌上的老爷 厨房里的女人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e86e6cc44803787fe48db5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e86e6cc44803787fe48db5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 13:23:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>只要姐妹有时间~妇女能顶半边天</span></p><span></span><p><span>为啥只能半边天？害！还不是因为只放半天</span></p><span></span><p><span>#Female Power</span></p><span></span><p><span>年过得可能一般般 但瓜是真香 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>要看瓜加我微信啊！！！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">3:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>这春节~男人味可太冲了<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>鼠鼠你啊大过年的遇到活阎王咯～ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>让老王碎掉的济公开胃丹哈哈哈哈 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>世界上最好吃的朱古力！！你们都给我去吃！！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> </span></p><span></span><p><span>要不是倒霉久了，你以为我爱迷信啊！！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>努力可不一定会有回报呢 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>建国后无鬼魂，但守鬼葬活人的传统还在 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> </span></p><span></span><p><span>天下防催婚第一大招 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>叔叔~我的喜酒您可能喝不上，不过您儿子的三婚客我一定来参加 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> </span></p><span></span><p><span>不用讨好，可以大方Say No的人生真的很棒 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3003">50:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Maximillian-Losing Game</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hearts&amp;Colors - I'm So Sorry</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】老李@vidaLi &nbsp;老王@辣炒阿嬷【求关注】小宇宙｜苹果播客｜网易云音乐｜喜马拉雅｜同步更新！ 更多平台敬请期待 【联系我们】 投稿&amp;合作邮箱：wandoujian244@163.com 敬请期待听友群～ 感谢收听「豌豆尖儿～」，下期再见</span></p>]]></description>
